      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As a thought, is there any reason to throw out the hard work of Lyuma and/or BlackStartX?\n\nIn other words, what if VRChat were to \"bless\" one or both, adopt it as the \"official emulator\", and provide the support that might be expected with such a blessing? Would that suffice?\n\nOr is this request more along the lines of \"integrate it directly\" vs requiring explicit VCC installation?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
